  <Strings>
    <Section>Story</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52556</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うわあぁ〜〜〜っ!?
ゼロムが現実に出てきてるぅ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoa! So there really IS xerom running around the real world?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52684</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これは……
ゼロムを捕まえる機械なのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Is this... some kinda machine for capturing xerom or something?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>52812</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>…………逆ね。
これは多分、人間にゼロムを
憑依させる装置よ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I'd say the opposite. This is probably a device used to possess people with xerom.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>53612</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>さすがローレンツ君、ご名答だ！
これぞ、古代の遺産を復活させた
我輩自慢の逸品だヨ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I would expect no less of Ms Lorenz. A brilliant answer indeed! This is a Masterpiece I am proud to have restored from ancient times!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>54208</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Ines&gt;、こいつと
知り合いだったの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Do you two know each other?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>54336</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>仕事の関係でちょっと……ね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Let's say we've... worked together once.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>54464</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>再会の記念に、このすばらしい
古代技術について解説してやろう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, in commemoration of a reunion such as this, I shall divulge some secrets on the ancient technologies.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>54464</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ゼロムはスピルーンに寄生して
肉体や精神を、でたらめに
暴走させる。それがデスピル病だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Xerom are parasites that feed on one's Spirunes, causing the host's body and mind to run wild. This is what we call despir.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>54464</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だが、この装置はゼロムを
任意の感情に取り憑かせる事で
暴走を制御する事ができるのだ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>However, this device can control the rampage by forcing the xerom to focus on any emotion desired!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>54464</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>例えば、『怒り』の感情に
ゼロムを憑依させると
通常の何倍もの肉体能力を発揮し</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>For example, a xerom is focused on “anger” the host will demonsrate enhanced physical abilities, several times that of your average person.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>4</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>54464</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>恐怖も、悲しみも感じない
最強の兵士が誕生するんだヨ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This way, we can create the perfect soldier, one who feels neither fear or sorrow!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <BubbleId>5</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>54764</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>人をわざとデスピル病にして
戦わせるっていうのか？
一体何のために!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You're giving people despir on purpose to make them fight for you? Why would you do something like that?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>54892</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>決まってるだろッ！
調子に乗った教会と結晶騎士どもを
ぶっ殺すのサ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Because I've decided! I'm going to kill every last one of those at the church and their Crystal Knights and teach them their place!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>54892</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いや、このゼロム憑依兵に
さらにその少女のスピルーン
暴走の力を加えられたら……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And now, if I use this girl's Spirune to push my soldier's even further...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>54892</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>くひひっ、教会どころか
クソ生意気なシルバや上将まで潰し
我輩が世界を統べる事すらァ♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Gehehe, why stop at the church?! I could even teach that brat Silver a lesson, I could rule the entire world!! ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>55100</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>恐怖も悲しみも感じない兵士……
そんなの……って……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A soldier that can't feel fear or sorrow...? That's horrible...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>55228</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それこそがッ！　この天才
コーネルピンが解き明かした
ゼロムの正しい使い方なんだヨ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And there you have it! That's how I, the genius Kornerupin, discovered how to unlock the xerom's full potential!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>55604</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>天才!?　解き明かした!?
うそおっしゃい。一体誰に
やり方を教えてもらったのかしら？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Genius?! You really expect me to buy that!? Who taught you all this?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>55604</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あなたみたいなモロキュウで
アボガドなピーマン野郎が
ひとりでできる訳ないものね♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There's no way an “insult” could ever dream of doing it all by himself! ♪</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>55828</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>モロキュウで……
アボガドな……
ピーマン野郎……！！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>W-what did you just call me?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>55992</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>…………残念ながら
諸君は秘密を知りすぎたネ。
知人に免じて殺しはしないが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I'm afraid you've heard too much. Since we are old aquantances after, I shall let you live, however...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>55992</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>手足を切り落して、牢に転がし
ゆっくりとスピルーンの秘密を
聞き出すとしよう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll just have to tear you limb from limb, toss the rest of you in a cell and force you to tell me all you know about this Spirune.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>55992</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ローレンツゥ！　お前はその姿で
我輩の執務室に飾ってやるぞ！
泣いて喜べェェッ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And for you Lorenz?! You'll be displayed in my office as a trophy! You should be honored!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>57364</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うわぁぁ〜〜〜ん！
自分で喋ったんじゃないかぁっ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eeek! His only kidding, right?!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>64840</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ヴおおォォぉ〜〜〜ッッ！！！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>GRRAAH!!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>67052</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この野郎、待てッ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dammit, get back here!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
